Z||000006||842m8||12-19-2001||08:47 AM||||I've had the same type of experience! lol<BR>I was at the gas station and usually I pump my own gas but this was a full service one so they guy starts to put gas in my car and asked if I wanted my oil checked, I usually do that myself but I figured what the hell I'll have fun with this guy so I say sure so he stands at the front of my car and I pop the hood it took him a bit to figure out it open from the windshield he opens and realizes the engine is in the back. Its too funny the look on their faces lol||||reg||10
