Z||000010||avengador1||12-19-2001||08:39 PM||||I know the feeling. Last year I had to take mine for emissions and I had to make sure the jerks didn't try to run it with the parking brake on, like they did to my father's car. Over here they run the car up to 25 MPH and hold it there for a while. When they did my father's car the rear brakes started to smoke because they didn't release the parking brake. I guess they didn't see the brake light ON in the dash. When I took my Fiero I just left the brake off to not get a repeat incident. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
